00:09:59.399 --> 00:10:00.900
This carp and red bean soup

00:10:00.900 --> 00:10:01.634
How to do it?

00:10:01.634 --> 00:10:04.204
Prepare 50 grams of red beans.

00:10:04.204 --> 00:10:05.605
1 carp

00:10:05.605 --> 00:10:07.307
Of course, it's not easy to buy carp.

00:10:07.307 --> 00:10:09.642
That's if it's possible to buy it.

00:10:09.642 --> 00:10:11.744
Okay, wash the red beans clean.

00:10:11.744 --> 00:10:14.414
Clean the carp by removing its scales and innards.

00:10:14.414 --> 00:10:17.083
Add water, scallions, ginger, and salt, like this.

00:10:17.083 --> 00:10:18.284
But use less salt!

00:10:18.284 --> 00:10:19.619
Or you can omit the salt.

00:10:19.619 --> 00:10:21.387
Just stew it until it's cooked.

00:10:21.387 --> 00:10:22.489
This soup...

00:10:22.489 --> 00:10:24.390
It has the effect of qīng rè jiě dú (transliteration)

00:10:24.390 --> 00:10:26.359
Diuretic and swelling-reducing effects

00:10:26.359 --> 00:10:29.162
Suitable for people with edema

00:10:29.162 --> 00:10:30.063
I remember a patient

00:10:30.063 --> 00:10:30.897
from before

00:10:30.897 --> 00:10:32.866
His hands were swollen.

00:10:32.866 --> 00:10:33.900
feet are swollen too.

00:10:33.900 --> 00:10:34.934
Drank for a period of time

00:10:34.934 --> 00:10:36.769
About a month

00:10:36.769 --> 00:10:38.137
The swelling has gone down.

00:10:38.137 --> 00:10:39.906
Even edema after chemotherapy

00:10:39.906 --> 00:10:41.574
They are all very effective.

